// onsa.toml
// [test]
// spec = ["§4.4", "§15.1", "§18.1"]

// S-734, S-744 (W4-05 U2): two structs in two modules that hold each other. The cycle of the types
// goes through the modules and every item of another module is taken by a `use`, which is a dependency
// (§15.1), so it lies in a cycle of `use`: the report is the E0310 of the modules only, and there is no
// E0311 (§18.1: "モジュールをまたぐ宣言（型と定数）の循環は、必ず `use` の循環の中にあるので E0310
// だけを報告する"). The E0310 is at the first `use` of the cycle in the order of the diagnostics.
use b.{B}                        //~ E0310

pub struct A {
  b: B,
}
